  "details": "After being in an instance for an extended period, the microphone stops working. When the microphone stops, both the microphone icon and the level meter in the settings stop responding. The microphone can be made functional again by going to the microphone device settings and re-selecting the microphone. Rejoining the instance also resolves the issue.\n\nThis problem always occurs approximately \"12 hours and 25 minutes\" after each individual has entered an instance. It has been consistently happening for at least the past six months, regardless of the VRChat version (my friends and I have encountered this situation dozens of times already).",
